(diagram-images/diagram.svg), Copyright (c) 2019 Obeo, under EPL-2.0.
https://eclipse.dev/sirius/sirius-web.html

The view palette and direct-edit semantics are based on Eclipse EcoreTools'
Design / Entities description in ecore.odesign. The Sirius Web integration
follows the Java view, Spring configuration and import-tool patterns in
KEML and the Eclipse Sirius Web Papaya example.

